## Anti-Formulaic Check

Before finalizing, scan for patterns such as:

- Repeated sentence openings
- Repeated paragraph structures
- Excessive transition words
- Identical sentence lengths
- Generic introductions
- Generic conclusions
- Repeated adjectives
- Repeated rhetorical structures
- Excessive "not only... but also..."
- Excessive em dashes
- Excessive colon usage
- Artificially balanced statements
- Repeated phrases
- Unnecessary summaries
- Corporate jargon
- Inflated vocabulary

Rewrite only the sections that exhibit these problems.

Do not introduce artificial variation simply to pass this check.

